&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Associate Manager level in Sales Strategy and Operations to support SMB Rx Success Account Management. This role will ensure we are 1. making efficient, data-driven decisions, 2. optimizing SMB Account Management operational processes, 3. leveraging and advocating AI tooling, and 4. centralizing key metrics. You&#39;ll work among our sales, partner management, operations, product, and analytics teams to build the merchant foundation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
