&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post Sales SMB Account Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As an Associate Manager of Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations at DoorDash, you will play a key role in partnering with our post sales SMB team to accelerate growth for SMB restaurants. You will focus on increasing sales productivity and refining operational processes. You will help create structured processes that influence centralized sales metrics and will work across cross-functional teams to scale our restaurant partners’ businesses through sales and operational initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this role because you’ll…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to post-sales strategy for our top company priorities. This team sits at the nexus of both scaled initiatives and innovative bets at DoorDash focused on catapulting our restaurant partners’ growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational excellence in reporting cadences, rigorous pipeline tracking, and sales productivity – leading end-to-end ideation to execution through data-driven insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our cross-functional teams to expand and elevate our offering. To retain, optimize, and grow SMBs, this role will partner closely with internal DoorDash stakeholders to ensure our GTM processes across products and initiatives is effective and efficient for sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look around corners for the team. This role will be an owner in shepherding our Account Management team into the future, specifically as we use AI tooling to become more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience in operations, technology, banking, analytics or related experience with a track record of leading initiatives and hitting goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong cross functional business experience, project management, and communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working with large data sets + modeling in Excel / Google Sheets, proficiency in SQL, and well-versed in data visualization tools (e.g. Sigma, Tableau) to help solve ambiguous problems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to roll up their sleeves and flex up or down as needed - “humble doer”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a Bachelor’s degree or higher&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
