&lt;li&gt;Influence and engage across the company – partner with the product, engineering, and analytics, and cross-functional teams to establish goals and build strategic programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve through experimentation – use data-driven decision-making to run tests on everything to reduce fraud while accelerating growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
