&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash Labs is an independent robotics and automation team within DoorDash, focused on transforming last-mile logistics at scale. Our work reaches millions of people — and we&#39;re building the operational foundation to make that possible safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Manager of Operational Safety, you will lead the team responsible for safety systems, incident response, and SOP governance across DoorDash Labs&#39; autonomous products. You will set strategy, build and develop a team of safety specialists, and partner with engineering and product leadership to ensure safety is embedded into every phase of development. This is a senior leadership role for someone who thrives at the intersection of operational rigor and cutting-edge autonomy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the safety team — &lt;/strong&gt;hire, develop, and manage a team of operations safety specialists across remote and on-site functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set SOP strategy — &lt;/strong&gt;own the design, governance, and continuous improvement of standard operating procedures; drive compliance across all Labs programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own safety analytics &amp;amp; reporting — &lt;/strong&gt;establish metrics and KPIs for operational safety; present trends, risks, and recommendations to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead incident command — &lt;/strong&gt;oversee critical incident triage and resolution; ensure root cause analysis and corrective action processes are rigorous and timely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional safety programs — &lt;/strong&gt;partner with engineering, product, legal, and field operations to build safety into product design, launches, and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent safety externally — &lt;/strong&gt;engage with regulators, partners, and customers on safety standards and compliance as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in operations, safety, or a related field — autonomy, robotics, aerospace, or defense experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years managing or leading teams, with a track record of developing talent and building high-performing functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and scaling safety or operational systems in a regulated or safety-critical environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with the ability to influence senior stakeholders and present complex risk data clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset; comfortable with ambiguity and fast-changing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotation and promptly respond to on-call events with urgency and rigor on nights and weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with safety management systems (SMS), ISO 45001, or equivalent frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in designing, developing, and deploying comprehensive training programs and instructional materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with autonomous systems, robotics deployment, or fleet operations at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Workspace, Jira, and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the safety function at one of the most ambitious autonomy teams in tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct influence over systems that affect millions of real-world interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High visibility to DoorDash senior leadership and a clear path to Director-level growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, equity, and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
