&lt;p&gt;Our US Marketplace team is responsible for growing the DoorDash business in the US, helping customers to discover &amp;amp; order what’s best in their city, merchants to grow their sales, and dashers to find flexible work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The US Marketplace team is looking for a motivated and hands-on operator to be the Director of Local Markets. As a Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Director, you’ll be responsible for driving marketplace growth in every U.S. market, across a variety of market types.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Growth and Markets team, leading cross-functional collaboration between DoorDash’s marketing, sales, product, finance, and analytics teams to deliver new products and service level improvements to drive local market growth. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to help define new ways to grow locally, incubate 0-1 experiments, scope partnership opportunities, foster relationships with external partners, and execute on a roadmap to grow the marketplace at the local level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead - From day one you’ll lead a team, helping the team to further develop the muscle of lowest level of detail analyses and execution rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business development - Develop relationships with new growth partners and top merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence - Work cross-functionally across the US Marketplace Organization to help craft roadmaps, secure investment, and partner with other organizations to improve the user experience at local level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build – Explore growth opportunities alongside our partners in Product, Marketing, Analytics, Engineering, and Operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze – Shape and define our strategy based on quantitative and qualitative data, querying data directly and empowering yourself with AI tooling (Cursor, Claude)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate – Figure out how to get from A to B–then actually make it happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow – Help the business get 1% better every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 10+ years of experience in strategy &amp;amp; operations or other operating roles; high-growth startup experience is advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading cross-functional projects and hitting goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable running analysis and manipulating datasets; SQL is required and experience using AI tools (Cursor, Claude) is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You always look for ways to improve and want to shape the direction of the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can motivate people at all levels across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate high-level goals into relevant plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love getting to a low level of detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
