&lt;p&gt;DoorDash Drive is our B2B delivery platform, powering same-day and next-day fulfillment for merchants who need more than the marketplace. The Drive Growth &amp;amp; New Bets team owns four high-growth lines of business under Drive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pizza&lt;/strong&gt; — Reliability, efficiency, and quality programs for Pizza Hut, Domino&#39;s, and Papa Johns. Peak pay, flash offers, smart batching, and chatbots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health&lt;/strong&gt; — HIPAA-compliant specimen, blood-product, and pharma delivery for partners like Quest Diagnostics, LabCorp, AFC Urgent Care, and WellStreet, with active negotiations across major health systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tasks (new bet)&lt;/strong&gt; — A new 0→1 platform for Cx-app courier (peer-to-peer delivery) and Mx task dispatch (inventory restocking, point-to-point logistics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fleet Management (new bet)&lt;/strong&gt; — Self-serve dispatch and consumer tracking for merchants operating their own (1P) driver fleets; first builds going live with Pizza Hut and Hungry Howie&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring an Engineering Manager to lead this team. You&#39;ll own engineering execution across all four LOBs, partnering with Product, Analytics, BD, and Ops to scale established businesses and incubate new bets through stage-gated validation.&amp;nbsp; You must be located in the Sunnyvale, CA, San Francisco, CA, or Seattle WA area for this hybrid role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a multi-disciplinary engineering team (backend, mobile, web) across multiple LOBs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction and architecture for established platforms (Pizza, Health) and brand-new 0→1 builds (Tasks, Fleet Management)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, BD, and Ops on roadmap, GTM, and demand validation; stage-gate new-bet investments based on signal rather than executing a fixed backlog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop, and retain senior engineers; cultivate a strong ownership culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability, HIPAA compliance, on-time delivery, and operational excellence for mission-critical merchant deliveries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because you have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years managing full-stack engineering teams of 8+ engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;8+ years of total industry experience including hands-on engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed systems design and platform-scale execution experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product intuition and comfort partnering on roadmap and strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate with ambiguity — half the team&#39;s bets are explicitly new businesses we&#39;re incubating&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multiple LOBs or platforms in parallel is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
