&lt;li&gt;Be a founding member of the DoorDash Ads &amp;amp; Promos team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with multiple stakeholders to learn, streamline, and improve our processes and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow advertiser value and sustainable revenue for DoorDash by optimizing campaign delivery and performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive efficiency and productivity by executing campaign contracts,&amp;nbsp; managing campaign setup, and ensuring timely invoicing and payment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
