&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a 4-year college degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of experience in Ad operations, Performance Marketing, Marketing Operations, Digital Advertising, or Sales Operations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
