&lt;li&gt;Connect and collaborate with our existing partners to understand their unique goals, priorities, and current challenges&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Vendor leads on paths around how our Merchants Activate additional products on the DoorDash platform to empower merchant partner growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate unique solutions through sales trainings, data and analytical tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a pro in creating and revamping sales training materials, scripts, email templates, and more in an effort to provide the most effective tools to our Vendor partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listen to a high volume of Vendor calls in an effort to ensure we provide ample feedback to our partners and uncover growth opportunities for reps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
