&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years in a sales role focused on building relationships and providing sound business solutions to our partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are creative, motivated, and passionate about sales and have a dynamic personality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable working in a scaling startup environment and adapting quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You value collaboration and find opportunities within change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are tech-savvy and navigate sales and internal tools quickly (Salesforce, Chorus, Outreach, Sales Navigator, Google Apps)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
