&lt;p&gt;As Manager, Inside Post-Sale, you will lead a high-performing team responsible for growing and retaining one of DoorDash’s most important merchant segments. You’ll own performance outcomes, coach and develop talent, and shape the strategies that power revenue growth and product adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends sales leadership, operational rigor, and cross-functional partnership — ideal for a leader who loves building teams and improving systems in a fast-scaling environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop a team of Inside Sales Executives focused on revenue growth, and marketing product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear performance expectations and drive accountability to KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach &amp;amp; Develop Talent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consistent coaching, feedback, and career development support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of high performance, learning, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview, hire, onboard, and ramp new team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and refine processes that improve efficiency and team effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategy Through Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze performance metrics and pipeline health to inform business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify trends and recommend strategic improvements to Sales and Operations leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment &amp;amp; Optimize&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilot new outreach strategies, messaging, and workflows to unlock growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion operational improvements that enhance the merchant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Strategy &amp;amp; Ops, Product, Marketing, and Support teams to ensure merchants have the tools and processes they need to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 4+ years of inside sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of experience leading and developing sales professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of driving performance in a metrics-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable navigating ambiguity and thrive in scaling organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re analytical and use data to inform decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an authentic, grounded leader who builds trust quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve led cross-functional initiatives and can influence without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re skilled in performance management and talent development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
