&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce (or comparable CRM platforms)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Excel and Google Workspace&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
