&lt;p&gt;The US Local Markets team is responsible for growing DoorDash’s business at the local level. As the “local operators” at DoorDash, we identify &amp;amp; execute against opportunities to accelerate growth &amp;amp; improve our product across all three sides of the Marketplace (customer, merchant, Dasher).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash is looking for a Manager to join the Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team to accelerate growth in the Southeast &amp;amp; Texas regions. We are hiring out of Atlanta, Charlotte, Nashville (Southeast region) as well as Austin or Houston (Texas region).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience blending analytics and creativity to scope and implement solutions, working as an individual contributor and as part of a larger team. You move deliberately and with speed. You can reliably manage multiple workstreams at a low level of detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the General Manager of the US Local Markets team and manage a Strategy + Operations team based in your market. We expect this role to be hybrid, with some time in-office and some time remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own business outcomes &lt;/strong&gt;— Set and drive towards regional targets for growth and profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the team&lt;/strong&gt; — Recruit, lead, and develop high-performing candidates on the US Local Markets team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence –&lt;/strong&gt; Work cross-functionally with Ops, Product, Finance, Analytics, Sales, Marketing, &amp;amp; Dasher &amp;amp; Logistics partners to support strategic projects and unlock opportunities to grow region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate&lt;/strong&gt; – Figure out how to get from A to B–then actually make it happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment&lt;/strong&gt; - Run tests and scale insights. Embrace the challenge of having multiple paths forward and no right answer. Building a business in a competitive market is not easy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of experience. You’ve succeeded in high-performance cultures (whether in tech, operations, strategy, consulting, banking, or a related experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led and motivated a team before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a talent for summarizing complex problems, can translate high-level goals into relevant plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a bias towards action and can thrive in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re willing to get your hands dirty and you&#39;re open to feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You crave responsibility and want to shape the direction of the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in a complex or high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early stage startup experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required, MBA or Masters Degree a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics, Product Management, Business Operations and/or Partnerships experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications for this position are accepted on an ongoing basis.&lt;/p&gt;
