&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Technical Program Management&lt;/strong&gt; to lead and grow our Foundations TPM team. You will report to the Senior Manager of TPM within Engineering Operations and partner closely with Directors in Foundations Engineering to establish the vision and technical direction for our core systems.&lt;/p&gt;
