&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams of designers, operators, data scientists and engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product plans, benefits and results to key stakeholders including leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
