&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of Product Management Industry Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 4+ years of user-facing experience in industries such as eCommerce, technology or multi-sided marketplaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven abilities in driving product strategy, vision, and roadmap alignment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an execution power-house&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience presenting business reviews to senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have empathy for the users you build for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about DoorDash and the problems we are solving for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
