&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://click.appcast.io/greenhouse-te8/a31.png?ent=34&amp;amp;e=22630&amp;amp;t=1701374353806&quot; width=&quot;1px&quot;&gt; &lt;img style=&quot;display: none; max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://track.jobadx.com/v1/i.gif?utm_pixel=224e990b-8ff4-4287-8d5d-2ff09647f181&amp;amp;utm_ptz=EST&amp;amp;utm_rqt=track&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s an exciting time to join our rapidly growing Accounting team with ample development opportunities. We&#39;re looking for a Revenue Analyst to support revenue accounting operations by analyzing financial and transactional data, ensuring data accuracy, assisting with revenue reporting, and contributing to process improvement initiatives. The ideal candidate has strong analytical skills, a solid understanding of data management principles, and an interest in finance and accounting processes. Also to support our Revenue Accounting Data Team’s daily and monthly close operations while keeping pace within one of the fastest growing marketplace companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Revenue Data team is seeking a fully independent contributor who delivers reliable, high-quality data insights and supports revenue-driving decisions. They own defined problem areas, partner effectively with stakeholders, and translate data into clear, actionable insights. You will report into the Revenue Data Manager on our Accounting team within the Finance organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own revenue account reconciliations, accounting analyses, and data validation activities to ensure the accuracy and integrity of financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, analyze, and reconcile revenue data across accounting systems, ERP platforms, and operational databases, proactively identifying and resolving data discrepancies, anomalies, and reporting issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support month-end, quarter-end, and year-end close processes, including revenue reporting, reconciliations, and preparation of audit-ready documentation for internal and external audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain SQL queries, Python-based analyses, reports, and data extracts to investigate revenue trends, improve reporting accuracy, and deliver actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue Accounting, Finance, Business Operations, Product, and IT stakeholders to support revenue-related initiatives, new product launches, and order-to-cash processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvements by documenting business rules, automating manual reporting activities, enhancing data workflows, and strengthening data quality controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability and willingness to learn quickly, adapt to changing priorities, and effectively manage multiple tasks in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and proactive, with the ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment, manage competing priorities, and continuously develop new skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong SQL proficiency and hands-on experience with Python for data analysis and building data workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring foundational knowledge of US GAAP, revenue recognition principles, and SOX/internal controls, or equivalent experience at a large, publicly traded technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working with data tools such as NetSuite, dbt, or Fivetran to build reports, dashboards, and data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Business, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Applications for this position are accepted on an ongoing basis&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
