&lt;li&gt;Serve as the liaison between our clients and DoorDash management, product, support, marketing, and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop &amp;amp; foster partner relationships with C-suite as well as strategy, marketing, and operations leads to provide a best-in-class partnership&lt;/li&gt;
