&lt;li&gt;Analyze operational/financial data, uncover trends and assess current/future business risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own models and analyses to balance growth vs. profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional partners to develop new processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
