&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Associate on the DashPass Partnerships S&amp;amp;O team, you will own the ideation and execution of key international strategic partnerships to drive DashPass adoption and long-term growth. The role will focus specifically on optimizing our acquisition funnel, driving strategic growth actions, and developing our go-to-market strategy for new international partnership opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Associate Manager on our DashPass Partnerships team.&lt;/p&gt;
