&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment -&lt;/strong&gt; Own and operationalize data-driven experiments across everything from promotional campaigns to net new in-app creative assets, optimizing for what resonates with our consumers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze - &lt;/strong&gt;Assess the operational and financial impacts of your initiatives, using insights to iterate. You’ll be expected to self-serve the data required, empowering you to dive deep into performance metrics and continuously identify new opportunities to enhance the consumer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate - &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with a variety of internal teams across Marketing, Product, Data Science, Engineering, and Finance to execute on plans. Launch in-app merchandising for campaigns backed by media and CRM. Build relationships with external partners to collaborate and optimize the customer experience to reach ambitious business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re a strategic thinker&lt;/strong&gt; and are comfortable manipulating and analyzing data to make decisions. You have experience with SQL and Microsoft Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re able to manage multiple concurrent projects&lt;/strong&gt;, stay organized, and prioritize your time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have strong cross-functional skills&lt;/strong&gt; and have experience with projects spanning multiple teams and can align on mutual goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have strong communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and have collaborated with external partners in the past&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have experience with international partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;, or other global growth projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have a strong attention to detail&lt;/strong&gt;, the ability to adapt to a fast-paced environment, and the tenacity to solve many disparate problems for multiple stakeholders at once.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have 2-3 years experience&lt;/strong&gt; in operations, technology, consulting, business development, banking, analytics, marketing, high-growth or early-stage startup or related experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have a Bachelor&#39;s Degree &lt;/strong&gt;in business, marketing, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
