&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of maintaining and enhancing processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to collaborate with external partners to drive successful partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project and/or program management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success working in cross-functional engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in warehousing or supply chain implementation is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience translating technical concepts to business solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical knowledge of integrations, APIs and webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on working SQL experience to troubleshoot and self-serve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
