&lt;p&gt;Data is at the foundation of DoorDash success. The Data Engineering team builds database solutions for various use cases including reporting, product analytics, marketing optimization and financial reporting. By implementing pipelines, data structures, and data warehouse architectures; this team serves as the foundation for decision-making at DoorDash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About the Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoorDash is looking for a Softare Engineer II to be a technical powerhouse to help us scale our data infrastructure, automation and tools to meet growing business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/h1&gt;
