&lt;p&gt;Please see the independent bias audit report covering our use of Covey &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
