&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Product Enablement.&lt;/strong&gt; Be a hands-on product expert, helping clients and teammates leverage SevenRooms functionality based on unique business needs and goals.&lt;/li&gt;
